Z||000006||Uaana||11-15-2001||02:22 AM||||Had a similar one tonight as well. <BR>Coming back from buying a book and some girl with her BF in the pass seat started nosing me going down a 2 lane. I looked over and could see him egging her on. She was driving one of the newer Merc Cougars.. <BR>Well long story short. at 50 in 3rd I nail it and leave her and her BF both looking like deer caught in headlights. Next light he looks over, I give a shoulder shrug as if to say sorry for spanking their new car. <P>For those who don't know I drive an plain jane 85SE (doesn't even have a trunk light) with a fresh 3.4 sitting behind the firewall.<BR>Sometimes being the sleeper can be fun.||||reg||1
