Z||000020||Flamberge||11-17-2001||04:03 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Cozmo:<BR><B><BR>I egged on a guy in a new Turbo Carrera last week just to watch the car.  Those things are FAST  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> it was beautiful...<BR>  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Last night I was beside a Lotus (funny how my Fiero looked low to me until I pulled up to that guy) and I rolled off the line at normal speed, hoping he would gun it, but alas, he creeped off the line even slower than me. *shrugs* I work in a relatively nice area of Denver, so I see Ferraris on occasion, Porches, Vipers, etc. Like a car show every time I drive to work. *grin*<P><P>------------------<BR>- Flamberge<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://flamberge.iwarp.com/Serra3sm.jpg"> ||||reg||1
